│  Final Answer:                                                                                                                                  │
│  Looking ahead, solar panels are moving beyond traditional cells toward smarter, integrated energy solutions. Perovskite–silicon tandem cells   │
│  reached the mid‑30s in efficiency by 2025, with a late‑2024 certified record of 34.85% (NREL via LONGi) and lab demonstrations nudging toward  │
│  35%.                                                                                                                                           │
│                                                                                                                                                 │
│  Tandems began commercializing in 2025, as Oxford Photovoltaics shipped 24.5% tandem modules in late 2024 and pilot scale‑ups expanded.         │
│                                                                                                                                                 │
│  End‑of‑life recycling becomes policy‑driven business, with Europe and others pursuing frameworks and a 95% yield could recover 27,000–37,500   │
│  tons of silver from modules installed 2000–2025.                                                                                               │
│                                                                                                                                                 │
│  BIPV remains multi‑billion, Europe 41.8% demand, APAC ~40–41%.                                                                                 │
│                                                                                                                                                 │
│  Solar windows approach 12% lab efficiency but 1–3%.                                                                                            │
│                                                                                                                                                 │
